{"title": "Legendary Action: Sublimation", "pageid": 31404, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sublimation", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Sublimation</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> used by <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a>. After losing a piece of armour, Gerringothe can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">Legendary action</a> to try to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimation\" title=\"Sublimation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sublimate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimation\" title=\"Sublimation\">Sublimate</a> a foe. A creature that fails its save against this effect cannot move or take actions, bonus actions, or reactions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, if she loses a piece of armour, Gerringothe Thorm can spend a Legendary Action to try and turn her enemies into gold, incapacitating them for 4 turns. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Sublimation\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Sublimation </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sublimation_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Sublimation (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Sublimation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sublimation_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Sublimation (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Sublimation</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When she loses a piece of armour, Gerringothe Thorm can try to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimation\" title=\"Sublimation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sublimate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimation\" title=\"Sublimation\">Sublimate</a> her foes - turning them into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_to_Gold_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned to Gold (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"gold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Turned_to_Gold_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_to_Gold_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned to Gold (Condition)\">gold</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Sublimation does not instantly kill the target, as the tool-tip claims, but instead renders them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a>.</li>\n<li>Gerringothe may use her legendary action as many times per round as pieces of armour are destroyed.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214525\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1308/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13619/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5949/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639911/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.411      1 -total\n 99.04%   42.005      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 37.27